menu "Tokpet client"

config TOKPET_STATE_REFRESH_MS
    int "Tokpet state refresh interval (ms)"
    default 5000
    range 1000 3600000
    help
        How often the firmware polls companion `/state`. The companion
        runs on the same LAN, so 1–5s is comfortable and lets newly-added
        providers from the console show up on the device almost
        immediately. Increase only if you are seeing actual CPU / battery
        pressure.

endmenu
